sted at all, so the category assignment could not be verified as saved to the backend.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Selecting 'Tech Gadgets' in category combobox on /products filtered from 9 to 3 products, all labeled Tech, with result count '3 products found' updating instantly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products lists all 9 products, each article showing image, category badge, price, name (linked), brief description paragraph, star rating value, and a 'Buy Now' purchase action link.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort 'Price: Low to High' ordered Tech products as Sony $399, Samsung $1299, MacBook $1999 (ascending). Minimum Rating '4.5+ stars' filter reduced All Categories results from 9 to 8, correctly excluding Philips Hue (4.4 rating). Price range slider present with min/max labels.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Edits are lost on revisit/reload, not persisted\", \"actual\": \"After editing and saving Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra in admin (price/rating/description/tags/featured), navigating away to homepage/products and back to /admin showed the product reverted to its original pre-edit values, i.e. the edit did not remain available after revisiting.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Reviewed the full 9-product seed catalog on /products and /admin: each product displays exactly one category badge - 3 products tagged \\\"Tech\\\" (Sony WH-1000XM5, Apple MacBook Pro 14\\\", Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra), 3 tagged \\\"Home\\\" (Dyson V15 Detect, Philips Hue Starter Kit, Breville Barista Express), 3 tagged \\\"Fitness\\\" (Peloton Bike+, Theragun Pro, Bowflex SelectTech 552). No product shows multiple or zero category badges, and all categories fall within the three supported values (Tech Gadgets, Home Goods, Fitness).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combining category=Tech + rating 4.5+ returned only qualifying tech products; selecting tags 'wireless' and 'cordless' together returned exactly Sony (wireless) and Dyson (cordless) - each result satisfies at least one selected tag (OR logic), none violate the active criteria.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create Product form on /admin: (1) submitting entirely empty form triggered toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\" and did not create a product; (2) submitting with Name+Description filled but Price=-50 (negative) and Rating=7 (input has declared min=0/max=5 but out-of-range value accepted in field) was silently blocked - form remained on Create screen and admin product list stayed at 9 products (no new entry). Both invalid submissions failed to publish, confirming validation guardrails exist for required fields and price/rating bounds.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/nonexistent-product-xyz shows 'Product Not Found' heading with explanatory text and a link back to Browse All Products, no unrelated product data shown. /category/invalidcategory shows 'Category Not Found' heading with explanatory text, no product listing shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search text, category select, sort select, rating filter, and tag filter all updated the product list and result count instantly in the same snapshot without any page navigation/reload event.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra image link from /products navigated to /produc